{'symbol': 'MDLZ', 'date': '2022-03-01 09:05:00', 'title': "MONDELĒZ INTERNATIONAL'S SNACKFUTURES ANNOUNCES START-UPS SELECTED FOR COLAB CLASS OF 2022", 'text': "CHICAGO, MARCH 01, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- SNACKFUTURES, THE MONDELĒZ INTERNATIONAL, INC. (NASDAQ: MDLZ) INNOVATION AND VENTURE HUB, TODAY ANNOUNCED THE TEN MISSION-DRIVEN BRANDS SELECTED TO PARTICIPATE IN THE COLAB CLASS OF 2022. THE GLOBAL SNACKING LEADER'S START-UP ENGAGEMENT PROGRAM IS A COLLABORATIVE EFFORT BETWEEN ENTREPRENEURS AND GLOBAL EXPERTS TO DRIVE MUTUAL GROWTH THROUGH A 12-WEEK CURRICULUM. EACH START-UP ALSO RECEIVES A $20,000 GRANT."}